flowchart TB
    S1["1 · DISCOVER<br/>ARCHITECTURAL DRIVERS<br/>Stakeholders name the functions,<br/>constraints and quality attributes"]
    S2["2 · ESTABLISH SCOPE<br/>Drivers specification<br/>Statement of work<br/>Preliminary plan — no build schedule"]
    S3["3 · NOTIONAL<br/>ARCHITECTURE<br/>Run-time, code and<br/>physical views"]
    S4["4 · ARCHITECTURAL<br/>REVIEW<br/>Find and document the risks<br/>the architecture carries"]
    G{"5 · GO / NO-GO?"}
    E6["6 · EXPERIMENT PLANNING<br/>One targeted prototype<br/>per open risk"]
    E7["7 · EXPERIMENTS AND<br/>REFINEMENT<br/>Run them, record results,<br/>refine the architecture"]
    P6["6 · PRODUCTION PLANNING<br/>Every element gets an owner,<br/>an estimate inside tolerance,<br/>a place in the schedule"]
    P7["7 · PRODUCTION<br/>Build, integrate, test —<br/>whole system or increments"]
    S1 --> S2
    S2 --> S3
    S3 --> S4
    S4 --> G
    G -->|"NO-GO"| E6
    E6 --> E7
    E7 -.-> S4
    G -->|"GO"| P6
    P6 --> P7
    P7 -.->|"iterate as necessary"| S1
